# Welcome!

#### This professional learning module prepares you to teach **AI-Powered Threats and Defenses**—a unit that teaches students about the dynamic field of cybersecurity, focusing on how AI is transforming both the methods of cyberattacks (like phishing, malware, and denial-of-service) and the strategies used for digital defense (such as anomaly detection and adaptive authentication).

___

<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; width: 95%; margin: 20pt auto; padding: 0 5px;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/36211eedb3698751fa5523b4dde93351-image-1760467094025.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/7f813b0aec7d472e470f94eb91471aa1-image-1760466945803.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/ddb463a06ccc88f5d7390a1f841a0f31-image-1760467013014.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
</div>

___


#### **By the end of this professional learning module, you will be able to:**

* #### Understand the key components of computer systems—hardware, software, and operating systems—and their interaction through the Input-Processing-Storage-Output(IPSO) model.

* #### Explore simulations that help students connect hardware, software, data processing, and system optimization.

* #### Learn how computer systems and AI use data for processing, decision-making, and automation in real-world applications.


## Take Our Pre-Survey

#### To better gauge your learning and improve this professional learning module, please take our pre-survey - it will take fewer than five minutes to complete.

<div style="margin: 20px 0px">
<a class="btn btn-large btn-primary" href="https://studio.code.org/form/selfpaced_pd_teaching_aif_cybersecurity_pre_survey" target="blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Take the Pre-Survey</a>
</div>

### **Suggested total time for this module:** 60 minutes




 


